  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/JFF7vxPq/Lios-Outlandish-Village-1.png\" alt=\"Lios-Outlandish-Village-1\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">探索一个迷人的霍比特人风格村庄，它坐落在郁郁葱葱的山丘之中，充满了温馨的房屋和充满活力的村民。探索光线柔和的洞穴内部，在山顶的池塘边放松身心，并留意一个秘密按钮&mdash;&mdash;找到它即可解锁村民们隐藏起来的宝藏库！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/vC3r8VSc/compatibility.png\" alt=\"compatibility\" width=\"449\" height=\"41\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>本模组不会覆盖现有的原版村庄，因此与任何其他村庄重构模组（如 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lios-overhauled-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lio's Overhauled Villages</a>）完全兼容！作为全新系列“Lio's Outlandish Villages”的一部分，该系列旨在带来风格独特的城镇和充满冒险精神的建筑供你探索！</em></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/m5LGyB8T/morefromthisseries.png\" alt=\"morefromthisseries\" width=\"586\" height=\"36\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiral-tower-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qLJcs1SQ/spiral-towers.png\" alt=\"spiral-towers\" width=\"376\" height=\"62\"> </a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12)\"><a style=\"display:flex;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lioloader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wrK85wgc/logo.png\" alt=\"LioLoader\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n<div style=\"text-align:left;line-height:1.35\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">需要基于数据包（datapack）的配置？</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14px\">请查看 <strong>LioLoader</strong>，它支持全局数据包/资源包加载。适用于 <strong>Minecraft 1.21.x</strong> 的 <strong>NeoForge</strong> 和 <strong>Fabric</strong>。</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px\">在 CurseForge 上打开 LioLoader &rarr;</div>\n</div>\n</a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fV6VtS4Q/youtube-reviews.png\" alt=\"youtube-reviews\" width=\"605\" height=\"44\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n<p>-评测于 11:59-<br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rM1fSI28POk?start=719\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sPHes7q4Pr\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qDNhg49/636e0a6a49cf127bf92de1e2-icon-clyde-blurple-RGB.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"97\"></a></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/hJvQHRN5/usageinmodpacks.png\" alt=\"usageinmodpacks\" width=\"573\" height=\"39\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">欢迎将<strong>霍比特山丘村庄</strong>包含在你选择的任何 Minecraft 整合包中。我们鼓励你将这些结构融入自定义整合包中，构建独特且引人入胜的冒险体验。无需申请许可&mdash;&mdash;随意探索并享受这些村庄带来的乐趣吧！</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
